  "version": 1,
  "notes": "An eight-hundred-ton streamlined merchant built for jump-3 runs between busy worlds. Over 250 tons of hold served by a crane, twenty-six staterooms with room to spare for paying passengers, and ten low berths. It can skim and refine its own fuel. Two double turrets, each with a beam laser and a sandcaster, keep pirates honest without turning it into a warship.",
